docs {
  Contract gaps the Angular front found (F18.6): one run by its id, the inventory fields of the asset detail, ids,
  classes and totals of the pending inventory, the values of each sensitivity profile in the parameter schema and
  where a setup step's "done" comes from. They only read, so the folder runs any number of times.
